# Scalable Todo App with Auth Plan

## Architecture Overview
- Microservices: Frontend (React), Auth Service (Node.js), Todo Service (Node.js)
- Database: PostgreSQL with Redis caching
- Message Queue: RabbitMQ for async tasks

## Authentication Flow
- JWT tokens with 15-minute expiration
- OAuth2 for social logins
- Password hashing with bcrypt
- Refresh token rotation every 7 days

## Scalability Features
- Redis caching for frequent queries
- Message queue for background tasks
- Load balancing with Nginx
- Horizontal scaling with Kubernetes

## Tech Stack
- Frontend: React 18, TypeScript, Redux Toolkit
- Backend: Node.js 20, Express 4, TypeORM
- Database: PostgreSQL 15
- Auth: Passport.js with JWT
- Infrastructure: Docker, Kubernetes, AWS

## Security Considerations
- Rate limiting (60 requests/minute)
- Input validation (Zod)
- Session management with Redis
- HTTPS enforcement

## Testing Strategy
- Unit/integration/e2e tests

## Deployment Architecture
- Docker, Kubernetes, cloud providers

## Monitoring and Observability
- Logging, tracing, alerting

## Future-proofing
- API versioning, backward compatibility

